The substring route is correct but inefficient—the prover was still consuming CPU after three minutes while unfolding membership. I’m replacing that one source expression with six explicit whitespace comparisons, which is semantically identical for the declared ASCII model and aligns directly with the mathematical predicate used by the invariant.
