codex
The isolated state-2 claim revealed the actual performance issue: marking the recursive specification as a total K function makes the backend eagerly narrow its symbolic sequence forever. I’m changing those three symbols to ordinary recursively rewritten specification terms, so each proof unfolds exactly one constructor after the program consumes one character.
apply patch
